    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Scope: use tests/integration/seam/** (vertical-slice-seam) + tests/integration/regression/** KEEP paths only; MUST NOT add Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;, DI-registration, or ctor-null-check tests.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038">Scope: coverage is observation, not a gate — assert behavior (no 422, edits present, new version), not line coverage.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: assert render-on-save behaviorally — the surgical patcher/count-gate is not invoked on the NDA save; do not test private internals via reflection where a seam assertion suffices.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-007">Scope: exercise the save path through the SpeFileStore seam; do not introduce Microsoft.Graph mocks above SpeFileStore.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: these are MAINTAIN-class regression tests (the NDA 422 must never return) — mark/keep them so /test-diet retains them at their KEEP path.</constraint>
  </constraints>

